OL,3,GNEWSAFirm fined #24,000 over worker
OL,4,Acrushed in conveyor
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn aggregates company has been fined
OL,7,F#24,000 after a worker was pulled into
OL,8,Fa conveyor through a gap in its
OL,9,Fguarding and crushed to death.
OL,11,FManjit Kumar, 34, was operating the
OL,12,Fbag-flattening conveyor at Gill
OL,13,FAggregates Ltd's depot in Halyard
OL,14,FStreet, Dagenham, east London, on 24
OL,15,FJune 2020.
OL,17,FColleagues stopped the machine but the
OL,18,Fguarding had to be dismantled to free
OL,19,Fhim, and he died in hospital a few days
OL,20,Flater, the Health and Safety Executive
OL,21,F(HSE) said.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
