OL,3,GNEWSAFirm fined #24,000 over worker
OL,4,Acrushed in conveyor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm was sentenced at Snaresbrook
OL,7,FCrown Court on Monday after admitting
OL,8,Fbreaching workplace equipment
OL,9,Fregulations. It was also ordered to pay
OL,10,F#43,000 in costs.
